  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guiyang Transport Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Guiyang Transport Project will assist China in increasing the access and mobility of Guiyang Municipality&apos;s transport users through priority infrastructure investments while establishing more sustainable mechanisms for rural road maintenance, as well as enhancing capacity for keeping municipal debt under control. The project includes the following three components: A) Youxiao Road - the construction of an approximately 7 km four-lane to six-lane divided urban arterial road that connects the southeast corner of the Guiyang urban core, Youzhajie, to Xiaobi in Longdongbao; B) rural transport - the construction or rehabilitation of rural roads and rural bus stations; and, C) institutional development - develop the institutions of Guiyang municipality through studies, improvement of systems and training.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase the access and mobility of Guiyang Municipality&apos;s transport users through priority infrastructure investments while establishing more sustainable mechanisms for rural road maintenance, as well as enhancing capacity for keeping municipal debt under control.</narrative>
  </description>
